    "comments": {
      "en": "Nothing here is normative. The three patterns rest on standards, this ontology rests on design decisions of the work.\r\n\r\nThree subdomains are joined: the technical process after VDI 3682, the communication after ISO/IEC 7498-1, and the AI after ISO/IEC 22989.\r\n\r\nScope: the three patterns named above and the classes that tie them together. The payload of a transmission is equated with a dataset rather than kept apart from it."
    },
