          {
            "identifier": "note",
            "language": "en",
            "value": "A construct of this work, following the system elements of Haberfellner. It covers physical elements only.\r\n\r\nSoftware artefacts such as models or AI components are deliberately not modelled as components. They stay in the AI subdomain, and their place in the whole is recorded through the functions they realise and the assignment of those functions to a resource.",
